==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|припада́ть|-ок}}. {{sl|ru|pl|przypadek|senseid=accident!!favor}}, which eventually fell out of use due to higher use of the other meanings. Compare {{cog|cs|případek}}, {{cog|csb|przëpôdk}}, {{cog|pl|przypadek}}, and {{cog|szl|przipŏdek}}. Further compare {{cog|hu|eset}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|припа́док}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Pacha Tchernof-припадок.wav}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|припа́док|*|adj=припа́дочный}}

# [[seizure]]
# [[fit]], [[paroxysm]]
# [[attack]] {{gloss|medicine: sudden onset of a disease}}
# [[bout]], [[turn]]
# [[access]]
# {{senseid|ru|accident}} {{lb|ru|obsolete}} [[chance]], [[luck]], [[accident]]
# {{senseid|ru|favor}} {{lb|ru|obsolete}} [[favor]]

